      <activity id="d6f43c1a-c660-5710-a52c-d42e7aa2c297" activityNameId="f570c523-df4f-5799-8a00-275e231608c6" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production of liquid packaging board containers, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production of liquid packaging board containers, at plant
na;
UUID: afd961e7-17a6-394d-ad00-ed1829514fb2
This module includes the production of LPB containers for food packaging. It contains the steps of laminating, cutting, folding and printing. Besides the raw materials (LPB, aluminium and PE) inks and glues are considered as well as the energy consumption.; Geography: Data from the former Swiss packaging study and from several CER used as European average data.
Location:  Data from the former Swiss packaging study and from several CER used as European average data.
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_afd961e7-17a6-394d-ad00-ed1829514fb2.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
